§§ `בדיקת הטבלאות`

-- (1) The day: §4.1's, as the signed copy's annex א8 prints it.
#ASSERT `annex א'8 of the principals is updated from` EQUALS `the day §§4–5 apply the annex from` `annex א8 of the signed copy`
#ASSERT `annex א'8 of the principals is updated from` EQUALS `the day the annex prints` `annex א8 of the signed copy`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN t YIELD t's `published table from` EQUALS `annex א'8 of the principals is updated from`) `the tables of annex א'8 of the principals`

-- (2) The signed copy's annex א8, table for table and cell for cell: every
-- cell here is the cell of the signed copy's table in the same place, and
-- the two print as many.
GIVEN i IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER AND NUMBER TO MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the signed copy's annex א8 table` i IS
    GIVEN l, g YIELD `the signed-copy cell` (`the table numbered` i `in` `annex א8 of the signed copy`) l g

GIVEN i IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the cells the signed copy's annex א8 prints in table` i IS
    count (concat (map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `signed-copy row amounts`) ((`the table numbered` i `in` `annex א8 of the signed copy`)'s `signed-copy grid rows`)))

`the checks of annex א'8 of the principals` MEANS
    concat (zipWith (GIVEN i, t YIELD `the published cells beside` (`the signed copy's annex א8 table` i) `in` t)
                    (range 1 3) `the tables of annex א'8 of the principals`)

#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` `the checks of annex א'8 of the principals`)
#ASSERT and (zipWith (GIVEN i, t YIELD `the published cell count of` t EQUALS `the cells the signed copy's annex א8 prints in table` i) (range 1 3) `the tables of annex א'8 of the principals`)
#ASSERT count `the checks of annex א'8 of the principals` EQUALS 7 TIMES 8 PLUS 7 TIMES 8 PLUS 7 TIMES 7
#ASSERT map (GIVEN t YIELD t's `published table title`) `the tables of annex א'8 of the principals` EQUALS map (GIVEN g YIELD g's `signed-copy grid title`) (`annex א8 of the signed copy`'s `signed-copy annex grids`)

-- (3) Every table rises along its grades and down its levels.
#ASSERT all `the published table rises along its grades and down its rows` `the tables of annex א'8 of the principals`

-- The tables at work: the agreement's §4 for an academic principal of a
-- level-3 school at grade ב, beside the second table.
#ASSERT `the published table pay on` `annex א'8 of the principals is updated from` `annex א'8 of the principals, table 2` 3 2 EQUALS `the table salary under §4 on` 8 `annex א'8 of the principals is updated from` 2 3 2
